# probe (quest rework P7): an onMobDeath's optParams (the third argument luautils::OnMobDeath passes the lookup, once
# per alliance member in the killer's zone; isKiller true for the killer only) through the C# bridge (q.MobDeath).
# Knocking on Forbidden Doors (otherAreas 78; on C# since Other Areas group 4, whose `#alliance` flow holds these
# steps): Alsha's death, for the killer only, sets the killer's Prog 4 when any member of its alliance (the killer too)
# is at Prog 3. Main and bob (a party; both accepted at Prog 3 by a GM) at qm_alsha. Bob's 557, finished: Alsha popped
# and claimed by bob, FOUL_STENCH_OF_DEATH. Bob at Prog 0 (a GM) kills her: bob's handler (the killer) finds main's Prog
# 3 in the alliance list: bob's Prog 4; main's handler (not the killer) does nothing: main stays at Prog 3. Bob at Prog
# 3 again (a GM); main's 557, finished: Alsha popped for main; main kills her: main (the killer) Prog 4; bob (not the
# killer, at Prog 3) stays at 3. Recorded on the Lua quest (d8e21dfb, P7); the replay ran a test-only C# copy of its
# Misareaux Coast handlers (P7; removed in Other Areas group 5) and now runs the port, KnockingOnForbiddenDoors.cs.
# A new record refuses (a probe records Lua only). Not a quest port: the key names no quest (Program.IsProbe).
lists MisareauxCoast/qm_alsha/onTrigger MisareauxCoast/Alsha/onMobDeath MisareauxCoast/onEventFinish/557
char zone=MisareauxCoast pos=-152.8,-15.7,644.6 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=MisareauxCoast pos=-152.8,-15.7,646.1 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.KnockingOnForbiddenDoors accepted
charvar Quest[4][78]Prog 3
bob: quest OtherAreas.KnockingOnForbiddenDoors accepted
bob: charvar Quest[4][78]Prog 3
login
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
bob: trigger qm_alsha                   # bob, Prog 3, Alsha not up: 557
bob: finish                             # Alsha popped, claimed by bob; FOUL_STENCH_OF_DEATH
bob: charvar Quest[4][78]Prog 0         # a GM
bob: kill ALSHA                         # bob the killer: main at Prog 3 in the list: bob's Prog 4; main (not the killer): stays 3
tick 15000                              # Alsha's body despawning (the death and the despawn each take a zone tick)
tick 30000                              # despawned: popFromQM refuses a spawned mob
bob: charvar Quest[4][78]Prog 3         # a GM
trigger qm_alsha                        # main, Prog 3, Alsha not up: 557
finish                                  # Alsha popped, claimed by main; FOUL_STENCH_OF_DEATH
kill ALSHA                              # main the killer: Prog 4; bob (not the killer, at Prog 3): stays 3
